sequenceDiagram
		autonumber
		participant B as Browser SPA
		participant N as Nginx
		participant A as FastAPI
		participant M as MongoDB
		participant R as Redis
		participant W as Celery Worker

		B->>N: POST /api/bookings (JWT + booking payload)
		N->>A: Proxy request
		A->>A: Validate token, role, date constraints
		A->>M: Check overlapping bookings + idempotency key
		M-->>A: Conflict-safe result
		A->>M: Insert booking + audit event
		A-->>N: 201 Created (booking snapshot)
		N-->>B: Booking response

		A->>R: Enqueue follow-up tasks (notification/expiry)
		R-->>W: Deliver task message
		W->>M: Update booking/notification status later
		W->>M: Append background audit entry
